<!--
  Retail (game type "standard", 12.x) enforces the same secret values as WoW:
  Forever: health, power, auras, cast info and the identity of non-group units
  are unreadable from addon code under combat, encounter, challenge mode and
  PvP match restrictions. This manifest is modules_Camelot.xml plus the
  retail-only modules, each audited for secret reads (doc/forever-support.md
  §18). Player-owned resources (class power, runes, totems, combo points) stay
  plain for the player unit, so those modules load with small guards.
-->

